      "quoted_tweet_id": "1932058969322774645",
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Border security is economic security.\n\nThe violent riots in Los Angeles have made this undeniably clear.\n\nThe cost of hardware alone on these autonomous vehicles is estimated to be ~$97,000. Multiple have been set ablaze. All to the jeers of masked men waving foreign flags.\n\nPresident Trump’s One Big Beautiful Bill is key to putting America First.\n\nOBBB finishes construction of the border wall and provides funding for:\n\n➡️10,000 new ICE personnel\n➡️5,000 new customs officers\n➡️3,000 new Border Patrol agents\n\nWith the One Big Beautiful Bill, President Trump can secure our border once and for all. Congress must pass this legislation without delay.",
      "text_resolved": "Border security is economic security.\n\nThe violent riots in Los Angeles have made this undeniably clear.\n\nThe cost of hardware alone on these autonomous vehicles is estimated to be ~$97,000. Multiple have been set ablaze. All to the jeers of masked men waving foreign flags.\n\nPresident Trump’s One Big Beautiful Bill is key to putting America First.\n\nOBBB finishes construction of the border wall and provides funding for:\n\n➡️10,000 new ICE personnel\n➡️5,000 new customs officers\n➡️3,000 new Border Patrol agents\n\nWith the One Big Beautiful Bill, President Trump can secure our border once and for all. Congress must pass this legislation without delay.",
